1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,790
Kenapa tukang nggak pernah nyusun bata lurus-lurus?

2
00:00:03,950 --> 00:00:05,200
Coba tumpuk lurus.

3
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:07,250
Sambungannya jadi satu garis,

4
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:09,050
dari atas sampai bawah.

5
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:10,100
Kasih beban…

6
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:11,950
yang nahan cuma satu kolom.

7
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:12,950
Kalau retak,

8
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:14,650
langsung ikut garis itu.

9
00:00:14,900 --> 00:00:15,750
Kalau selang-seling,

10
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:18,550
tiap bata ditopang dua bata di bawahnya.

11
00:00:18,700 --> 00:00:20,050
Bebannya menyebar ke kanan-kiri,

12
00:00:20,150 --> 00:00:21,050
kayak piramida.

13
00:00:21,250 --> 00:00:22,100
Menurut uji,

14
00:00:22,300 --> 00:00:24,950
didorong angin dari depan…

15
00:00:25,050 --> 00:00:26,650
tembok tumpuk lurus cuma sekitar

16
00:00:26,750 --> 00:00:30,100
30 persen sekuat tembok selang-seling.

17
00:00:30,300 --> 00:00:32,250
Retaknya nggak bisa lari lurus.

18
00:00:32,350 --> 00:00:33,900
Harus belok di tiap bata,

19
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:35,350
jadi susah merambat.

20
00:00:35,550 --> 00:00:38,850
Jadi, selang-seling itu bukan cuma biar rapi…

21
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:40,150
biar bebannya dibagi.

22
00:00:40,300 --> 00:00:42,700
Follow, buat fakta rumah berikutnya!
